      "sling:resourceType": "cq/experience-fragments/editor/components/buildingblock",
      "text_copy2128385850254523": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
        "text": "<p>With another academic year in the U.S. getting underway for students and parents, AEDs can help save lives in elementary and secondary schools, as well as on college campuses.</p>\n<p>Sudden cardiac arrest strikes 7,000 children and teens every year, according to the American Heart Association.<sup>1</sup> Yet fewer than half of the states in the U.S. require AEDs in schools.<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>Learn more about why every elementary and secondary school should seriously consider having one:<br>\n</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 14 2023 15:35:48 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
