      "text_copy212838585022129009733338299": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
        "text": "<p>Most colleges go to great lengths to promote safety on campus, including providing security personnel, a student health center and mental health services. University campuses are busy public settings, populated with students, faculty and visitors of all ages and hosting many events including conferences, concerts, sporting events and academic competitions.</p>\n<p>Learn more about the best ways to keep all members of a campus community safe from sudden cardiac arrest:<br>\n</p>\n",
